Wait until previous script is finished before starting a new one:

```sqf
0 spawn
{
    _script = scriptNull;
    for "_i" from 1 to 10 do
    {
        waitUntil { isNull _script };
        _script = _i spawn
        {
            hint format ["script %1 started", _this];
            sleep 1;
            hint format ["script %1 finished", _this];
            sleep 0.2;
        };
    };
};
```

