notes.text:
**Using with:**

```sqf
with profileNamespace do {
    myVariable = "Hello!";
};
```

**is the same as:**

```sqf
profileNamespace setVariable ["myVariable", "Hello!"];
```

This allows you to quickly modify/use variables within a namespace without using **get/setvariable** every time.
